---
import { CURSORS, FACES, ROBOT, URLS } from "../components/pixel/assets";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>PIXEL STYLE DEMO | 张小伦的网络日志</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="像素风格首页 demo：逆向自 en.yoyu.design 的视觉与交互，仅供学习演示。"
    />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="/pixel/img/common/favicon.svg"
      type="image/svg+xml"
    />
    <script is:inline>
      (() => {
        try {
          const stored = localStorage.getItem("pixel-demo-motion");
          const reduce = matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
          if (stored === "off" || (stored === null && reduce)) {
            document.documentElement.classList.add("motion-off");
          }
        } catch {}
      })();
    </script>
    <style is:global>
      @import "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DotGothic16&family=IBM+Plex+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&display=swap";

      :root {
        --ink: #111114;
        --paper: #ffffff;
        --red: #ff4130;
        --yellow: #eeff5a;
        --cyan: #63ddff;
        --green: #00b995;
        --pixel-font: "DotGothic16", "IBM Plex Sans JP", monospace;
        --body-font: "IBM Plex Sans JP", "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB",
          "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        margin: 0;
        scrollbar-width: none;
      }

      html::-webkit-scrollbar {
        display: none;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--body-font);
        background-color: var(--paper);
        background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #e9ecf2 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(to bottom, #e9ecf2 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(to right, #dfe3ec 1px, transparent 1px),
          linear-gradient(to bottom, #dfe3ec 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 8px 8px, 8px 8px, 40px 40px, 40px 40px;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      html:not(.motion-off) body {
        cursor: none;
      }

      @media (pointer: coarse) {
        html:not(.motion-off) body {
          cursor: auto;
        }
      }

      img {
        image-rendering: pixelated;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
      }

      .layer {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100vw;
        height: 100vh;
        pointer-events: none;
        image-rendering: pixelated;
      }

      #walker-canvas {
        z-index: 1;
      }

      #idle-canvas {
        z-index: 50;
      }

      #trail-canvas {
        z-index: 60;
      }

      #explosion-canvas {
        z-index: 61;
      }

      #cursor-canvas {
        z-index: 62;
      }

      html.motion-off #cursor-canvas,
      html.motion-off #trail-canvas,
      html.motion-off #explosion-canvas,
      html.motion-off #idle-canvas {
        display: none;
      }

      html.motion-off *,
      html.motion-off *::before,
      html.motion-off *::after {
        animation-play-state: paused !important;
      }

      /* ---------- loading ---------- */

      #loading {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        background: var(--paper);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 24px;
        transition: opacity 0.2s step-end;
      }

      #loading.is-done {
        opacity: 0;
      }

      #loading .kid {
        position: relative;
        width: 72px;
        height: 72px;
      }

      #loading .kid::before,
      #loading .kid::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-size: 100% 100%;
      }

      #loading .kid::before {
        background-image: url("/pixel/img/top/icons/animation/characters/kid-01/side-turning-01.svg");
        animation: kid-a 960ms step-end infinite;
      }

      #loading .kid::after {
        background-image: url("/pixel/img/top/icons/animation/characters/kid-01/side-turning-02.svg");
        opacity: 0;
        animation: kid-b 960ms step-end infinite;
      }

      @keyframes kid-a {
        0% { opacity: 1; }
        16.6667% { opacity: 0; }
        33.3333% { opacity: 1; }
        66.6667% { opacity: 0; }
        83.3333% { opacity: 1; }
      }

      @keyframes kid-b {
        0% { opacity: 0; }
        16.6667% { opacity: 1; }
        33.3333% { opacity: 0; }
        66.6667% { opacity: 1; }
        83.3333% { opacity: 0; }
      }

      #loading .text {
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 16px;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      #loading .text span {
        opacity: 0;
        animation: dot 1600ms step-end infinite;
      }

      #loading .text span:nth-child(1) { animation-name: dot-1; }
      #loading .text span:nth-child(2) { animation-name: dot-2; }
      #loading .text span:nth-child(3) { animation-name: dot-3; }

      @keyframes dot-1 {
        0% { opacity: 1; }
        75% { opacity: 0; }
      }

      @keyframes dot-2 {
        0% { opacity: 0; }
        25% { opacity: 1; }
        75% { opacity: 0; }
      }

      @keyframes dot-3 {
        0% { opacity: 0; }
        50% { opacity: 1; }
        75% { opacity: 0; }
      }

      /* ---------- header ---------- */

      .site-header {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        z-index: 20;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 14px 24px;
      }

      .site-header .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 14px;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .site-header .brand img {
        width: 28px;
        height: 28px;
      }

      .site-header .right {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .site-header nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 18px;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      .site-header nav a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .site-header nav a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline 2px;
      }

      .pixel-btn {
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        border: 2px solid var(--ink);
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        padding: 6px 10px;
        box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .pixel-btn[data-on="false"] {
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--paper);
      }

      .pixel-btn:active {
        transform: translate(2px, 2px);
        box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--ink);
      }

      /* ---------- first view ---------- */

      .page {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .first-view {
        position: relative;
        height: 100svh;
        min-height: 620px;
      }

      #stage-canvas {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        pointer-events: none;
        image-rendering: pixelated;
      }

      .first-view__heading {
        position: absolute;
        top: 15vh;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      .first-view__logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .first-view__logo img {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
      }

      .first-view__logo h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 58px);
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      }

      .first-view__tagline {
        margin: 18px 0 0;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 18px);
        color: #44444a;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .first-view__characters {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .first-view__characters figure {
        position: absolute;
        margin: 0;
        animation: bob 1.7s steps(2, jump-none) infinite;
      }

      .first-view__characters img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }

      .face--a {
        left: 11%;
        top: 47%;
        width: 144px;
        height: 144px;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }

      .face--b {
        left: calc(50% - 108px);
        top: 35%;
        width: 216px;
        height: 216px;
        animation-delay: -0.6s;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }

      .face--c {
        right: 9%;
        top: 42%;
        width: 180px;
        height: 180px;
        animation-delay: -1.1s;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }

      .robot-fig {
        width: 72px;
        height: 72px;
        pointer-events: auto;
      }

      .robot--1 {
        left: 25%;
        top: 30%;
      }

      .robot--2 {
        right: 23%;
        top: 31%;
        animation-delay: -0.9s;
      }

      @keyframes bob {
        0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
        50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
      }

      .first-view__actions {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 3.5%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      .secondary-cta {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 14px;
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      .secondary-cta img {
        width: 16px;
        height: 16px;
      }

      .cta-wrap {
        position: relative;
      }

      #cta {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 17px;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--paper);
        background: var(--ink);
        border: 2px solid var(--ink);
        padding: 16px 26px;
        text-decoration: none;
        box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 rgba(17, 17, 20, 0.25);
      }

      #cta img {
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        filter: invert(1);
      }

      #cta:hover {
        transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
        box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 rgba(17, 17, 20, 0.3);
      }

      .burst-face {
        position: absolute;
        width: 22px;
        height: 22px;
        background: var(--red);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        animation: pop 1.2s steps(2, jump-none) infinite;
      }

      .burst-face img {
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
        filter: invert(1);
      }

      .burst-face--a { left: -30px; top: -14px; }
      .burst-face--b { right: -30px; top: 8px; animation-delay: -0.4s; }
      .burst-face--c { right: 14px; top: -24px; animation-delay: -0.8s; }

      @keyframes pop {
        0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
        50% { transform: translateY(-5px); }
      }

      .cursor-lab {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .chip {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 7px;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        border: 2px solid var(--ink);
        background: var(--paper);
        padding: 6px 10px;
        box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
        user-select: none;
      }

      .chip img {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
      }

      .chip:hover {
        transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
      }

      /* ---------- lab notes ---------- */

      .lab-notes {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 8vh auto 14vh;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      .lab-card {
        background: var(--paper);
        border: 2px solid var(--ink);
        box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink);
        padding: 32px 34px;
      }

      .lab-card h2 {
        margin: 0 0 18px;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 24px;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
        padding-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .lab-card p {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.9;
        margin: 0 0 14px;
      }

      .lab-card .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      .lab-card .links a {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 12px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 2px solid var(--ink);
        padding: 6px 10px;
        box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
        background: var(--paper);
      }

      .lab-card .links a:hover {
        transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
      }

      .lab-card .links img {
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
      }

      .lab-card .copyright {
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6b6e77;
      }

      .site-footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-family: var(--pixel-font);
        font-size: 12px;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        padding: 26px 0 34px;
      }

      /* ---------- responsive ---------- */

      @media (max-width: 780px) {
        .site-header nav {
          display: none;
        }

        .face--a {
          left: 6%;
          top: 44%;
          width: 108px;
          height: 108px;
        }

        .face--b {
          left: calc(50% - 72px);
          top: 38%;
          width: 144px;
          height: 144px;
        }

        .face--c {
          right: 5%;
          top: 46%;
          width: 108px;
          height: 108px;
        }

        .robot--2 {
          display: none;
        }

        #cta {
          font-size: 15px;
          padding: 14px 20px;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .first-view__characters figure,
        .burst-face {
          animation: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div id="loading">
      <div class="kid"></div>
      <div class="text">LOADING<span>.</span><span>.</span><span>.</span></div>
    </div>

    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/pixel" data-cursor="bunjiro">
        <img src={URLS.mark} alt="" width="28" height="28" />
        <span>PIXEL STYLE DEMO</span>
      </a>
      <div class="right">
        <nav aria-label="demo links">
          <a href="/" data-cursor="question">BLOG</a>
          <a href="https://en.yoyu.design/" data-cursor="question" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">YOYU</a>
          <a href="https://rea.tools/" data-cursor="question" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">REA</a>
        </nav>
        <button id="kids-toggle" class="pixel-btn" type="button">KIDS ON</button>
        <button id="motion-toggle" class="pixel-btn" type="button">MOTION ON</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="page">
      <main>
        <section class="first-view" aria-label="pixel banner">
          <canvas id="stage-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

          <div class="first-view__heading">
            <div class="first-view__logo">
              <img src={URLS.mark} alt="" width="56" height="56" />
              <h1>PIXEL STYLE DEMO</h1>
            </div>
            <p class="first-view__tagline">
              Take the cursor for a walk. Reverse-engineered with REA.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="first-view__characters" aria-hidden="true">
            <figure class="face--a">
              <img src={FACES["teacher-01"].def} alt="" width="144" height="144" />
            </figure>
            <figure class="face--b">
              <img src={FACES["teacher-02"].def} alt="" width="216" height="216" />
            </figure>
            <figure class="face--c">
              <img src={FACES["teacher-03"].def} alt="" width="180" height="180" />
            </figure>
            <figure class="robot-fig robot--1">
              <img src={ROBOT.closed} alt="" width="72" height="72" />
            </figure>
            <figure class="robot-fig robot--2">
              <img src={ROBOT.open} alt="" width="72" height="72" />
            </figure>
          </div>

          <div class="first-view__actions">
            <a class="secondary-cta" href="#lab-notes" data-cursor="question">
              WHAT IS THIS?
              <img src={URLS.chevronDown} alt="" width="16" height="16" />
            </a>
            <div class="cta-wrap">
              <span class="burst-face burst-face--a" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src={CURSORS.heart.src} alt="" width="14" height="14" />
              </span>
              <span class="burst-face burst-face--b" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src={CURSORS.question.src} alt="" width="14" height="14" />
              </span>
              <span class="burst-face burst-face--c" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src={CURSORS.voice.src} alt="" width="14" height="14" />
              </span>
              <a id="cta" href="#lab-notes" data-cursor="mail">
                <img src={URLS.mail} alt="" width="20" height="20" />
                <span>TALK TO THE PIXELS</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="cursor-lab" aria-label="cursor playground">
              <span class="chip" data-cursor="question">
                <img src={CURSORS.question.src} alt="" width="18" height="18" />
                <span>？</span>
              </span>
              <span class="chip" data-cursor="heart">
                <img src={CURSORS.heart.src} alt="" width="18" height="18" />
                <span>HEART</span>
              </span>
              <span class="chip" data-cursor="voice">
                <img src={CURSORS.voice.src} alt="" width="18" height="18" />
                <span>VOICE</span>
              </span>
              <span class="chip" data-cursor="robot">
                <img src={CURSORS.robot.src} alt="" width="18" height="18" />
                <span>ROBOT</span>
              </span>
              <span class="chip" data-cursor="bunjiro">
                <img src={CURSORS.bunjiro.src} alt="" width="18" height="18" />
                <span>BUNJIRO</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="lab-notes" id="lab-notes">
          <div class="lab-card">
            <h2>WHAT IS THIS?</h2>
            <p>
              这是一个像素风格首页 demo：用 REA（Reverse Engineer Anything）
              对 en.yoyu.design 做了一次逆向分析，还原它的视觉语言与交互架构——
              网格纸背景、DotGothic16 像素字、多层 Canvas 2D 像素引擎、
              变形光标与彩色拖尾、漂浮脸视线跟随、背景行人、闲置屏保冲屏。
            </p>
            <p>
              把鼠标动起来试试：悬停下面的角色与按钮，光标会变形、拖尾会变色；
              点击任意处会炸出像素方块；挂机 9 秒，会有大家伙冲过屏幕。
              右上角可以随时关掉动效（MOTION）或送走小孩（KIDS）。
            </p>
            <div class="links">
              <a href="/" data-cursor="mail">
                <img src={URLS.mail} alt="" width="14" height="14" />
                <span>回到博客</span>
              </a>
              <a href="https://en.yoyu.design/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-cursor="question">
                <img src={URLS.question} alt="" width="14" height="14" />
                <span>原版 en.yoyu.design</span>
              </a>
              <a href="https://rea.tools/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-cursor="heart">
                <img src={URLS.heartRed} alt="" width="14" height="14" />
                <span>rea.tools</span>
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="copyright">
              仅供学习演示，不做商用、不会提交。页面中的图形素材版权归
              YOYU DESIGN 所有，字体为 Google Fonts 开源的 DotGothic16 /
              IBM Plex Sans JP。
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>

      <footer class="site-footer">:ZL · 像素版 2026</footer>
    </div>

    <canvas id="walker-canvas" class="layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <canvas id="idle-canvas" class="layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <canvas id="trail-canvas" class="layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <canvas id="explosion-canvas" class="layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <canvas id="cursor-canvas" class="layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

    <script>
      import "../components/pixel/main";
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
